<div class="wrap">
  <div class="article-body" style="padding-top: 40px;">

    <h2>Our editorial standard</h2>
    <p>Before any guide is published, it must satisfy three requirements:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Official source required.</strong> Every fix must trace back to the manufacturer's or software vendor's own support documentation — Microsoft, Apple, Intel, Synology, and so on. General forum advice or unverifiable claims are never used.</li>
      <li><strong>Human review.</strong> No article is published automatically. Every piece is reviewed by a person before it goes live.</li>
      <li><strong>Honest language.</strong> We use phrases like "according to official documentation" rather than implying personal testing we haven't done.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What we cover</h2>
    <p>DonanimKlinik focuses on specific, diagnosable tech problems: software error codes, hardware faults with documented solutions, and configuration issues with official resolution paths. We do not cover:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Security vulnerabilities or exploits</li>
      <li>Techniques that could cause data loss if followed incorrectly</li>
      <li>Content that requires bypassing manufacturer security measures</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Our content categories</h2>
    <p>We publish guides across four categories: <a href="/computers">Computers</a>, <a href="/networking">Networking</a>, <a href="/software">Software</a>, and <a href="/peripherals">Peripherals</a>. Each category focuses on problems that have clear, official resolution paths.</p>

    <h2>Who writes this</h2>
    <p><strong>DonanimKlinik Editorial Team</strong><br>
    Every guide on this site is written against the manufacturer's own support documentation — Microsoft, HP, Canon, NETGEAR, Google, Dropbox, and a dozen others. We don't publish a fix unless it has an official source URL attached. If the manufacturer hasn't documented it, we don't cover it.</p>

    <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
    <p>Found an error in one of our guides, or have a suggestion? We take accuracy seriously. You can reach us at: <strong>donanimklinik@gmail.com</strong></p>

  </div>
</div>

